From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muthukumar <mk@verveflux.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Feb 2026 06:20:34 +0530
Subject: Fix FontFace.loadForBinding skipping real load when override is
 present

When a loadOverride is registered, skip calling the real load() method
to avoid triggering a sandbox DCHECK failure (CanLoadInProcess) in
renderer processes on macOS. Return the FontStatusPromise directly
instead, which is the same promise load() would return.

diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/css/font_face.cc b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/css/font_face.cc
index ae5992de6e48a5c81b1cad7456a3484652efb692..17ef384c293307769516f5ff283fefb9795d8892 100644
--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/css/font_face.cc
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/css/font_face.cc
@@ -610,6 +610,9 @@ ScriptPromise<FontFace> FontFace::loadForBinding(ScriptState* script_state) {
                      nullptr)
               .ToLocal(&override_result)) {
       }
+      // Skip the real font load to avoid triggering sandbox DCHECK
+      // failures in renderer processes (CanLoadInProcess check).
+      return FontStatusPromise(script_state);
     }
   }
   return load(script_state);
